# Vendored / build trees

These paths are huge and rarely the task surface.

- Do not explore or summarize this tree unless the user named a file here or a bug clearly originates in a vendored plugin.
- Prefer the wrapper/API used from `lib/` over editing forks under `third_party/`.
- Never bulk-read generated `build/` output.
